# Frontend specific
# We keep the src/ and public/ but ignore any build outputs inside them
# Vite build outputs
# Note: We are keeping the following:
# - src/ (frontend source)
# - public/ (frontend static assets)
# - backend/ (backend source, but note: the code is in backend/backend/)
# - We are ignoring the model file and logs and venv inside backend/

# We are not ignoring the following because they are small and useful:
# - requirements.txt
# - package.json, package-lock.json
# - tsconfig.json, vite.config.ts, tailwind.config.js, postcss.config.js
# - Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, railway.json
# - LICENSE, README.md
